.TH PRODBOX_internal_kind_controller 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-internal-kind-controller \- Run one managed kind node attempt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox internal-kind-controller
.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal program submitted by the kind launcher inside the kind controller unit. Exact retained records, artifacts and an observed placement are required; arguments alone grant no admission and only a test identity is admitted.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBprodbox internal-kind-controller /path/selected.dhall bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb /path/prodbox sha256:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa /path/result 900000000000 600000000000 610000000000 640000000000 700000000000\fR
Closed envelope supplied by the kind launcher
